          "title": "Basic Actors",
          "task": "Actors are the base class for everything\r\na 3D model is an actor\r\na UI control is an actor\r\na 2D sprite is an actor\r\n\r\nall of these things inherit from actors. So there should be Actor3D which is then inherited by other actor types such as a mesh\r\n\r\nActor2D inherits from Actor also. they all have a Transform and can be parented to one another and will inherit positions from their parents.",
